>h2 Features 21-24: Networking and C Compatibility
>tree open Features 21-24: Networking and C Compatibility
- Feature 21: DNS + TCP connect + HTTP GET
- Feature 22: TCP listen/accept server smoke test
- Feature 23: full-access binding sanity for network/kernel helpers
- Feature 24: wide C/HolyC spellings, attributes, labels/goto,
  enum/array constant expressions

Useful commands:
